# Agent-system maintenance

- Treat `.agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` and `.agents/specialists/<name>.md` as canonical.
- Do not directly edit generated `.cursor/agents/` or `.codex/agents/` adapters; change the specialist definition and rerun the sync script.
- Keep skills focused, concise, and explicit about trigger, inputs, outputs, validation, and handoff.
- Run the adapter sync check and agent-system validator after changes.
